3" 13194139535130 true] [17592186332793 1145 "The integral is defined over a type II region.\n\nFirst, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as a constant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{y-1}^{0}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,dx\\,dy & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}[{\\int }_{y-1}^{0}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,dx]\\,dy \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}[-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x]_{y-1}^{0}\\,dy \\\\  & =-{\\int }_{0}^{1}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡0-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(y-1))\\,dy \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(y-1)-1)\\,dy\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(y-1)-1)\\,dy & =[\\operatorname{sin}⁡(y-1)-y]_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(0)-1)-(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-1)-0) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(1)-1\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535130 true] [17592186332794 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332795 13194139535130 true] [17592186332794 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332796 13194139535130 true] [17592186332794 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332797 13194139535130 true] [17592186332794 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332798 13194139535130 true] [17592186332794 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332799 13194139535130 true] [17592186332794 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535130 true] [17592186332794 1041 "selection" 13194139535130 true] [17592186332794 1104 #edb/ref 17592186332798 13194139535130 true] [17592186332794 1110 #uuid "6ad702c6-d355-5943-9183-a343509e57b9" 13194139535130 true] [17592186332795 1034 "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(1)" 13194139535130 true] [17592186332795 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535130 true] [17592186332795 1111 #uuid "3c11b4dc-13bd-511e-8f5f-7b447c4ebe7a" 13194139535130 true] [17592186332796 1034 "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(1)+1" 13194139535130 true] [17592186332796 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535130 true] [17592186332796 1111 #uuid "34b04a54-facd-5181-be17-e6881fede358" 13194139535130 true] [17592186332797 1034 "1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(1)" 13194139535130 true] [1